UnitConcreteVotingRewardsManager::SupplyAt
├── when there are no global checkpoints
│   └── it should return zero
└── when there are global checkpoints
    ├── when there are no checkpoints before or at the timestamp
    │   └── it should return zero
    └── when there are checkpoints before or at the timestamp
        ├── when the timestamp matches the checkpoint timestamp
        │   └── it should return the sum of the global bias and permanent lock balance
        └── when the timestamp does not match the checkpoint timestamp
            ├── when there are no slope changes
            │   └── it should return the sum of the decayed global bias and permanent lock balance
            └── when there are slope changes
                ├── it should apply slope changes at epoch boundaries
                └── it should return the sum of the decayed global bias and permanent lock balance
